  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 303.06 Steel Tank Institute and Steel Plate Fabricators Association (STI/SPFA)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 303.06 Steel Tank Institute and Steel Plate Fabricators Association (STI/SPFA). The following standard, from STI/SPFA 955 Donata Court, Lake Zurich, Illinois 60047, (847) 438-8265, http://www.steeltank.org, SP001 “Standard for the Inspection of Aboveground Storage Tanks”, seventh edition, 2024 (SP001) shall apply as noted in the rules and summarized in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 300) #10487, eff 2-7-14; ss by #14094, eff 10-4-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or300.html"
